From 223f910fa29d6dee9c8f1029547b32d0fda948c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:41:28 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Pick 7 v2: formation, star budget, simplified scoring with
 MOTM and fair play

Pick 7
- Fixed formation: exactly 2 DEF, 2 CM, 1 CAM, 2 ATT (positions in config/club.ts).
  Gurinder has no position, so stays on the roster but can't be picked.
- Star budget: 1-3 stars per player, at most 14 per seven. Ratings re-rate after
  each draw from ownership (>60% +1, <10% -1, needs 4+ teams), derived not stored.
  A seven pushed over budget stays legal; edits can't raise its total.
- New picker: formation bench, per-position progress, budget meter, ownership %,
  swap sheet when a position is full, save button says what's missing.
- Old sevens that don't fit aren't entered at the draw; banner, picker and a
  "fix your team" reminder email tell the user.

Scoring (v2, match days from 19 Nov 2026; earlier matches keep v1)
- Goal +3, assist +2 (none on penalties/free kicks), own goal -2,
  Man of the Match +4 (one per team, required), fair play +1 (default on,
  removed for a foul, card, dissent warning or dangerous challenge).
- No second assists or deflection rulings. Rules version pinned per match.
- Scorecard editor gains MOTM pickers and a fair-play list; match report,
  table, rules and home pages updated.

Tests: 77 (14 new in lib/league/pick7.test.ts).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PtuBR2yKPy8UddCaB5RWRB
